# Simple square pyramid test mesh: 5 vertices, 5 faces (4 triangles + 1 quad base).
# Used by ObjMeshLoaderTests to exercise fan-triangulation and negative (relative)
# vertex indices, and by SceneLoader mesh-loading tests.
v 0 1 0
v -1 0 -1
v 1 0 -1
v 1 0 1
v -1 0 1

f 1 2 3
f 1 3 4
f 1 4 5
f 1 5 -4
f 2 3 4 5
